{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14390","headline":"春眺扬州西上岗寄徐员外 · 朱长文","name":"春眺扬州西上岗寄徐员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芜城西眺极苍流，漠漠春烟间曙楼。\n瓜步早潮吞建业，蒜山晴雪照扬州。\n隋家故事不能问，鹤在仙池期我游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱长文","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}